      <MissionDesc>Services for Seniors-The Mission of the Peninsula Shepherd Center is to provide a support system which helps allow for older adults to live independently and self-sufficiently in their homes for as long as possible, while providing opportunities to learn, to grow and serve. Our Tag Line is "Empowering Senior Independence". Our Vision is a community that honors, respects and cares for older adults. We operate in a defined geographical area and do not duplicate existing local services.The Peninsula Shepherd Center is a 501(c)(3) organization that serves seniors, 60 and older, in the Point Loma (92106), Ocean Beach (92107) and Midway/Sports Arena (92110) areas of the City of San Diego.</MissionDesc>
